Date: Fri, 29 May 2026 09:28:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] test(governance): cover delta dump + refresh worker

Adds plugins/governance/dump_refresh_test.go (35 tests) for
patch3/delta-counter-dump:

- DumpBudgets / DumpRateLimits: basic INCREMENT; zero-delta skip;
  rebase-only short-circuit (no transaction issued); sequential dumps
  emit only the new delta; two-pod and 8-pod concurrent dumps with no
  contribution loss; deadlock retry with baseline preservation;
  non-deadlock error propagation; multi-row sort-by-ID lock order
- RefreshAllFromDB: basic pull; preserves pending local delta on top of
  cluster total; clamps negative pending to zero; adopts newer DB
  LastReset; keeps newer local LastReset; cleans baselines for missing
  rows; concurrent Bump + refresh stays consistent; DB errors propagate
- Two-pod dump+refresh lifecycle converges on both pods after final
  refresh; rebase-after-peer-reset works cleanly
- 4-pod stress across 5 budgets: no contribution loss

Uses fakeConfigStore (in-memory SQLite) so dump/refresh exercise real
gorm transactions and row-level UPDATE locks. Two LocalGovernanceStore
instances sharing one fakeConfigStore faithfully simulate two pods
sharing one Postgres.
